  "ListSql": "SELECT CONVERT(varchar(20), [p].[ID]), [p].[Name], [p].[Price], [p].[TrackingMethod], [p].[ReleaseDate], [p].[LastSaveDate], [p].[IsDraft], [p].[IsDeleted], [b].[Name], [p0].[Name], CONVERT(varchar(20), [p].[ProductCategoryID]), CONVERT(varchar(20), [p].[ProductBrandID]), CASE\r\n    WHEN [p].[CityID] IS NOT NULL THEN CONVERT(varchar(20), [p].[CityID])\r\nEND, [p].[HasActiveAttention], [p].[HighestSeverity], [p].[ActiveSignalCount], [p].[ID], [b].[ID], [p0].[ID], [s].[ID], [s].[Name], [s].[Color], [s].[Description], [s].[IntegrationID], [s].[ProductID], [s].[TagsID], [s].[ID0]\r\nFROM [Products] AS [p]\r\nINNER JOIN [Brands] AS [b] ON [p].[ProductBrandID] = [b].[ID]\r\nINNER JOIN [ProductCategories] AS [p0] ON [p].[ProductCategoryID] = [p0].[ID]\r\nLEFT JOIN (\r\n    SELECT CONVERT(varchar(20), [t].[ID]) AS [ID], [t].[Name], [t].[Color], [t].[Description], [t].[IntegrationID], [p1].[ProductID], [p1].[TagsID], [t].[ID] AS [ID0]\r\n    FROM [ProductTags] AS [p1]\r\n    INNER JOIN [Tags] AS [t] ON [p1].[TagsID] = [t].[ID]\r\n) AS [s] ON [p].[ID] = [s].[ProductID]\r\nORDER BY [p].[ID], [b].[ID], [p0].[ID], [s].[ProductID], [s].[TagsID]",
